{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_032emi0234_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_032emi0234_1000_p", "source_sha256": "45f0a3f1587eb63e9d6dc3b3c5ca2e9d56cb5c5c04df605da87d768905f6ae32", "ja": "エミリー、お疲れさま。\n新しい衣装の着心地はどうだろう？", "zh": "艾米莉，辛苦了。\n新衣服穿起来感觉怎么样？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_032emi0234_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_032emi0234_1001_032emi", "source_sha256": "b11f947cb41fa59ecc6907399b0f47e8a3a613e86203097daca440214dea14c8", "ja": "はい！　問題ありません。\n素敵な衣装、本当にありがとうございます……！", "zh": "好的！没问题。\n这么漂亮的服装，真的非常感谢您……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_032emi0234_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_032emi0234_1002_032emi", "source_sha256": "267b1ab2dae159e1fc252004e945d59772b55e0af2e05fb7e91bd361e67519eb", "ja": "神秘的で、とっても綺麗で……。\nそうそう、見てください、仕掛け人さま！", "zh": "神秘而且非常漂亮……。\n对了对了，请看这里，幕后推手大人！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_032emi0234_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_032emi0234_1003_032emi", "source_sha256": "5aa1b8cbdf92fc6b447de87f0198004bffbb8a67fd095150ae60af815d381b36", "ja": "この羽も、一枚一枚、丁寧に作られていて、\n芸術品のようで……うっとりしてしまいます♪", "zh": "这羽毛也是一片一片精心制作的，简直就像艺术品一样……让人不禁看得入迷♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_032emi0234_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_032emi0234_1004_p", "source_sha256": "3af4af91e844101e64d1202a103233cbac824466b571aeca1fe8217c3ea41abf", "ja": "喜んでもらえたみたいでよかった。\n資料とにらめっこをした甲斐があったよ。", "zh": "你能喜欢真是太好了。\n不枉我对着资料苦思冥想了那么久。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_032emi0234_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_032emi0234_1005_032emi", "source_sha256": "02d290f03f03dbb5eea0abaeb659836bf119335ffb1e3d79d2e5b6658a539b7a", "ja": "はいっ、あ、ですが……仕掛け人さま。\nあの……ええと。", "zh": "好的！啊，不过……制作人先生。\n那个……呃。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_032emi0234_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_032emi0234_1006_p", "source_sha256": "6fcb1703223eed1c25936a98d7539b23743d24d2a39ec66a14c5f0d4f51e5c8d", "ja": "ん？　なにか気になることがあるのか？", "zh": "嗯？有什么在意的事吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_032emi0234_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_032emi0234_1007_032emi", "source_sha256": "19195781c0b56c0d12047c7dfba54e4d7d4999dbd73c36a9821683b537353197", "ja": "この衣装は、その……よく見てみると、\nかなり大人っぽい雰囲気というか……。", "zh": "这套服装……那个……仔细一看，感觉相当成熟……或许该说是……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_032emi0234_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_032emi0234_1008_032emi", "source_sha256": "45c915fe5255c83784759d974fe04b58046f38c1216504e9f624b33fda122a82", "ja": "ろ、露出が、多いので……。\nきちんと着こなせているかどうか、不安なのです。", "zh": "露、露出度很高……\n我很担心自己有没有好好穿出它的感觉。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_032emi0234_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_032emi0234_1009_032emi", "source_sha256": "4c16631bb7c0778c34be4701847771ea91961d3754b590133734dfe09c8caf7f", "ja": "鏡で見ていると、自分の子供っぽさが\n目立ってしまうような気がして……うう。", "zh": "照镜子的时候，总觉得自己的孩子气变得格外明显了……呜呜。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_032emi0234_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_032emi0234_1010_p", "source_sha256": "35e635077693914dfd60f1957d21ac32393d837a3ec2f50338f749563d61155c", "ja": "そうか？　見たところ、そんな印象ないけどな。\nむしろ天使らしい、清らかな雰囲気があっていいよ。", "zh": "是吗？我看着倒没那种感觉。\n反而有种天使般的清纯气质，很不错啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_032emi0234_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_032emi0234_1011_032emi", "source_sha256": "f6b040158d699124fa100a543eb6a5c0a0c6047f374bfa2882d620db070e75de", "ja": "えっ？　そ、そうでしょうか……。\nでもこれは、堕天使の衣装なのでは？", "zh": "咦？是、是这样吗……。\n不过这不是堕天使的服装吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_032emi0234_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_032emi0234_1012_p", "source_sha256": "0b65fb4d4c618f7242bd515b0b712334f2cbae75965338267bade6bcc0b59dd3", "ja": "うん、でも元は天使だったわけだから。\nそういう神々しい感じは、あっていいと思うんだ。", "zh": "嗯，不过毕竟原本是天使嘛。\n我觉得有这种神圣庄严的感觉挺好的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_032emi0234_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_032emi0234_1013_p", "source_sha256": "3901518c054b7e921481e35e9948745d82a928f19101941a573588bd314a29be", "ja": "ちょっとセクシーな衣装だけど、だからこそ逆に、\nエミリーの清楚なイメージにピッタリだよ。", "zh": "虽然是有点性感的服装，但正因为如此，反而特别符合艾米莉清纯的形象。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_032emi0234_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_032emi0234_1014_032emi", "source_sha256": "c3cf0eecd3992ea06b9bcd9a9ea0f3d17084c6409d62ffe917858d5d4d9c1480", "ja": "はうぅ……し、仕掛け人さま……♪\n褒めていただけるのは、嬉しいのですが……。", "zh": "呜呜……制作者大人……♪\n能得到您的夸奖，我很高兴，可是……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_032emi0234_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_032emi0234_1015_032emi", "source_sha256": "f7edbf754541cc37375c0513d6fd1b14c0fc0496cefd4df5bb434fcb2a7f7b15", "ja": "そ、そんな風に面と向かって言われてしまうと、\n顔がにやけてしまいます……♪", "zh": "被、被这样当面夸奖的话，脸上就会不由自主地露出笑容……♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_032emi0234_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_032emi0234_1016_032emi", "source_sha256": "6d28af679ad6f6352320e68f995ce08ef3da5d6f812ca320a7337ccedac07751", "ja": "こんな顔をしていては、神々しさが失われて\nしまいますよね……しっかりしなければ！", "zh": "要是一直保持这样的表情，就会失去神圣感了吧……我得振作起来才行！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_032emi0234_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_032emi0234_1017_p", "source_sha256": "c908e9472bda113d1c5769f5347d6e88f08dda965dae1fbb8e03dae764a04097", "ja": "はは。今くらいはいいんじゃないか？\n素直に喜んでくれたら、俺も嬉しいよ。", "zh": "哈哈，至少现在这样也没关系吧？\n你能坦率地感到高兴，我也会很开心。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_032emi0234_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_032emi0234_1018_032emi", "source_sha256": "2c3b6156ea1424ce549950458fbf60314c79d11831b45b9b2f6450feee490402", "ja": "そ、そうですか？　えへへ……私、堕天使なのに。\n今は、天にものぼる心地です……♪", "zh": "是、是吗？　嘿嘿……明明我是堕天使。\n可现在却感觉心情都要飞上天了……♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
